        },
        {
          "text": " “Nyamara banze kukumvira barakugomera, birenza amategeko yawe, bica abahanuzi bawe bari abahamya babo bo kubakugarurira, bakora ibirakaza bikabije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo cyatumaga ubahāna mu maboko y'ababisha babo bakabababaza. Nuko iyo babonaga amakuba bakagutakira warabumvaga uri mu ijuru, kandi ku bw'imbabazi zawe nyinshi wabahaga abo kubakiza, bakabakura mu maboko y'ababisha babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko iyo bamaraga kugira ihumure barongeraga bagacumura imbere yawe. Ni cyo cyatumaga ubarekera mu maboko y'ababisha babo bakabatwara, ariko iyo bahindukiraga bakagutakambira wabumvaga uri mu ijuru, ukabakiza kenshi kuko imbabazi zawe ari ko zari ziri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lewi 18.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ukaba umuhamya wabo ngo ubagarure mu mategeko yawe, ariko bakībona ntibumvire amategeko yawe, ahubwo bagacumura mu byo wategetse, kandi ari yo umuntu yakora akabeshwaho na yo. Intugu zabo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " zikadohoka, bakagamika amajosi bakanga kumva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.13+2KI.17.14+2KI.17.15+2KI.17.16+2KI.17.17+2KI.17.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abami 17.13-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.15+2CH.36.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngoma 36.15-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ariko wabihanganiye imyaka myinshi, ubahamisha umwuka wawe wavugiraga mu bahanuzi bawe ariko banga gutega amatwi. Ni cyo cyatumye ubahāna mu maboko y'amahanga yo mu gihugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ku bw'imbabazi zawe nyinshi ntiwabatsembaga rwose kandi ntiwabataga, kuko uri Imana y'imbabazi n'ibambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
