                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Nuko rero Mana yacu, Mana nkuru ikomeye itera ubwoba, ikomeza gusohoza isezerano ikagira ibambe, ntukerense imiruho yose twagize n'abami bacu n'abatware bacu, n'abatambyi bacu n'abahanuzi bacu, na ba sogokuruza n'ubwoko bwawe bwose, uhereye ku ngoma z'abami ba Ashūri ukageza ubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mu byatubagaho byose wowe warakiranukaga kuko wakoraga ibitunganye, ariko twebwe tugakora ibibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n'abami bacu n'abatware bacu, n'abatambyi bacu na ba sogokuruza ntibitondeye amategeko yawe, kandi ntibumvaga ibyo wategetse n'ibyo wabahamirije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bari mu bwami bwabo bakabona kugira neza kwawe kwinshi, bakaba mu gihugu kigari cyera cyane wabihereye. Ntibagukoreraga kandi ntibarekaga imirimo yabo mibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None dore turi abaretwa, n'igihugu wahaye ba sogokuruza ngo batungwe n'imbuto n'ibindi bintu byiza byo muri cyo, tugihatswemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi icyo gihugu gihesha inyungu abami washyiriyeho kudutegeka tuzira ibicumuro byacu, ndetse bafite n'ubutware ku mibiri yacu no ku matungo yacu uko bashaka, none dufite umubabaro cyane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
